OL,3,GNEWSAPlans confirmed to reopen Glens of
OL,4,AAntrim Potato crisp factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliam Miller from Milgro said they
OL,7,Fare "committed to rebuilding the team
OL,8,Fat the Cushendall site and creating a
OL,9,Fsustainable future for the business".
